      "side": 1,
      "message": "right, we might have to check for \"Dimm\" separately or change the value type of the map to make the interface a `std::optional`, or otherwise handle it.\n\nMy overall point is that we do not need to sanitize something that was wrong to begin with but that we can just drop the invalid thing.\n\nI will drop this comment as it would be scope creep to rework all that config parsing code.",
